flowchart TD
    U[User Message] --> O{Orchestrator\nintent + plan decomposition}

    O -->|search intent| S[Search Agent]
    O -->|itinerary edit intent| T[Travel Editor Agent]
    O -->|small talk| C[ChitChat Agent]

    S --> ST[Search Tool Node\nweb/place lookup]
    ST --> S

    T --> TE[Travel Tool Executor\nadd/delete/move/swap/replan/optimize]
    TE --> T

    S --> R[Critic Node\nreflection check]
    T --> R

    R -->|approve| F[Response Formatter]
    R -->|revise| O
    R -->|confirm required| H[Human Approval Gate]

    H -->|approved| F
    H -->|rejected| O

    F -->|more steps pending| O
    F -->|done| END((End))

    C --> END
